{"fsPath":"/home/moiz/.cursor/plans/backend_codebase_overview_e555a9c3.plan.md","fileUuid":"db84dc70-d0ad-4e2d-9918-5c82e737a233","fileSizeBytes":10467,"numLines":271,"diffChanges":[{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":3,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":4,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":3,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":4,"addedLines":["overview: A reusable TypeScript/Express backend starter built on Clean Architecture. It ships with auth, user management, SmartRouter, OpenAPI docs, and enforced layer boundaries — domain features (e.g. pizza delivery) are added per project on top of this base."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000153]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":5,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":7,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":5,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":10,"addedLines":["  - id: document-base","    content: Add README and .env.example documenting this as a reusable starter and how to extend it","    status: pending","  - id: polish-base","    content: Fix package.json deps, consolidate auth into use cases, remove dead code, unify PrismaClient"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000154,1000155,7,1000156,1000157]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":9,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":13,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":12,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":13,"addedLines":["    content: Wire Role enum into User schema and add role-based authorization middleware (reusable across projects)"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000158]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":15,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":16,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":15,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":16,"addedLines":["    content: Add Vitest/Jest test suite for core base features (auth, users, SmartRouter)"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000159]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":22,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":25,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":22,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":105,"addedLines":["## What This Is","","This is a **reusable backend foundation** — not a finished product. The repo lives under a pizza delivery project name, but the code intentionally provides a **project-agnostic starter** that can be cloned and extended for any domain (e-commerce, SaaS, internal tools, etc.).","","**Included in the base (ready to reuse):**","- Clean Architecture layer structure with ESLint boundary enforcement","- JWT auth with refresh token rotation and reuse detection","- User CRUD use cases","- `SmartRouter` — declarative routes with Zod validation + auto OpenAPI","- `Result<T>` error handling pattern","- Request context via `AsyncLocalStorage`","- Prisma + MongoDB persistence with mappers","- Swagger UI at `/api-docs`","","**Added per project (not in the base):**","- Domain-specific entities (e.g. Pizza, Order, Product)","- Business routes and use cases","- Role/permission rules specific to that app","- Frontend integration","","```mermaid","flowchart TB","    subgraph base [Reusable Base - what you have]","        SmartRouter[SmartRouter + Swagger]","        Auth[JWT + Refresh Tokens]","        Users[User CRUD]","        Patterns[Result / BaseService / Mappers]","        Layers[Clean Architecture + ESLint boundaries]","    end","","    subgraph perProject [Added Per Project]","        DomainEntities[Domain entities + value objects]","        UseCases[Commands / Queries]","        Routes[Domain routes]","        Schema[Prisma models]","    end","","    base --> perProject","```","","---","","## Tech Stack","","| Concern | Choice |","| ------- | ------ |","| Language | TypeScript (strict, ES2022) |","| Framework | Express 5 |","| Database | MongoDB via Prisma ORM |","| DI | tsyringe |","| Validation + OpenAPI | Zod + `@asteasolutions/zod-to-openapi` |","| Auth | JWT access tokens + hashed refresh tokens (bcrypt for passwords) |","| Security | helmet, cors |","| Docs | Swagger UI at `/api-docs` |","","**Entry point:** [`src/WebApi/server.ts`](src/WebApi/server.ts) → [`src/WebApi/app.ts`](src/WebApi/app.ts)","","---","","## Architecture (Clean / Hexagonal)","","Layers are enforced by [`eslint.config.js`](eslint.config.js) via `eslint-plugin-boundaries`:","","- **WebApi** — HTTP routes, middleware, Swagger, DI container","- **Application** — use cases (commands/queries), DTOs as Zod schemas","- **Domain** — entities and value objects (no framework deps)","- **Infrastructure** — JWT, bcrypt implementations","- **Persistence** — Prisma schema, mappers","- **Common** — `Result<T>` pattern, errors, request context","","Path aliases in `tsconfig.json`: `@webapi/*`, `@application/*`, `@domain/*`, etc.","","### Reusable patterns (the real value of this base)","","1. **`SmartRouter`** ([`src/WebApi/utils/smartRouter.ts`](src/WebApi/utils/smartRouter.ts)) — one place to define method, path, validation, auth, handler, and OpenAPI. Copy this pattern for every new feature module.","","2. **`Result<T>` pattern** — use cases return `Result` instead of throwing; HTTP status mapping in [`handleRequest.ts`](src/WebApi/utils/handleRequest.ts).","","3. **Request context** — [`requestContext.ts`](src/Common/context/requestContext.ts) via `AsyncLocalStorage`; services extending `BaseService` get the current user for free.","","4. **Mapper layer** — [`UserMapper.ts`](src/Persistence/mappers/UserMapper.ts) is the template for every new Prisma model.","","5. **Use case layout** — `commands/` for writes, `queries/` for reads, co-located Zod DTOs. Follow [`CreateUser.ts`](src/Application/services/users/commands/CreateUser.ts) as the reference implementation."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000160,15,1000161,15,1000162,1000163,1000164,1000165,1000166,1000167,1000168,1000169,1000170,15,1000171,1000172,1000173,1000174,1000175,15,19,20,1000176,23,1000177,1000178,1000179,1000180,25,15,1000181,1000182,1000183,1000184,1000185,25,15,1000186,48,15,1,15,49,15,1000187,1000188,1000189,1000190,1000191,1000192,1000193,1000194,1000195,1000196,15,1000197,15,1,15,61,15,1000198,15,63,64,65,66,67,68,15,69,15,1000199,15,1000200,15,1000201,15,1000202,15,1000203,15,1000204]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":43,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":44,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":123,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":124,"addedLines":["        RoleEnum[Role enum - stub for future use]"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000205]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":63,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":137,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":143,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":172,"addedLines":["","---","","## Base API Endpoints","","| Method | Path | Auth | Purpose |","| ------ | ---- | ---- | ------- |","| GET | `/` | No | Health check |","| POST | `/login` | No | Password login or refresh token grant |","| GET | `/users/me` | Yes | Current user profile |","| POST | `/users` | Yes | Create user (admin-style provisioning) |","| GET | `/users/:id` | Yes | Get user by ID |","| PUT | `/users/:id` | Yes | Update email/fullName |","| GET | `/api-docs` | No | Swagger UI |","","**Login** supports a discriminated union body (`grant_type: \"password\" | \"refresh_token\"`) in [`AuthenticateRequest.ts`](src/Common/request/AuthenticateRequest.ts). Refresh flow includes token rotation and reuse detection.","","---","","## Base Data Models","","[`src/Persistence/prisma/schema.prisma`](src/Persistence/prisma/schema.prisma):","","- **User** — `id`, `email`, `passwordHash`, `fullName`, `createdAt`","- **RefreshToken** — `id`, `userId`, `tokenHash`, `expiresAt`, `revoked`, `createdAt`","","Domain: [`User`](src/Domain/entities/User.ts) entity + [`Email`](src/Domain/valueObjects/Email.ts) value object.","","**Stub for extension:** [`Role`](src/Domain/enums/role.ts) enum (`ADMIN` / `USER`) exists but is not yet wired into schema or middleware — a natural next step for the base itself."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[15,1,15,1000206,15,1000207,1000208,1000209,1000210,1000211,1000212,1000213,1000214,1000215,15,1000216,15,1,15,1000217,15,1000218,15,1000219,1000220,15,1000221,15,1000222]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":162,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":167,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":197,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":198,"addedLines":["Protected routes use [`authenticate.ts`](src/WebApi/middleware/authenticate.ts). Optional extensions for the base: logout endpoint, password reset, role-based middleware."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000223]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":172,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":173,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":203,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":204,"addedLines":["From [`.env`](.env) (no `.env.example` yet):"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000224]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":175,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":179,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":206,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":210,"addedLines":["- `DATABASE_URL` — MongoDB with `replicaSet=rs0`","- `JWT_ACCESS_SECRET`, `JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN`","- `JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN_DAYS`","- `JWT_REFRESH_SECRET` — defined but unused"],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000225,1000226,1000227,1000228]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":181,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":182,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":212,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":212},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":190,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":216,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":220,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":246,"addedLines":["## How to Extend for a New Project","","Follow the existing User module as a checklist:","","1. **Domain** — Add entity + value objects under `src/Domain/`","2. **Prisma** — Add model to `schema.prisma`, run `prisma db push`","3. **Persistence** — Add mapper under `src/Persistence/mappers/`","4. **Application** — Add command/query with Zod DTOs under `src/Application/services/<feature>/`","5. **WebApi** — Add `<feature>.routes.ts`, wire in [`app.ts`](src/WebApi/app.ts) via `SmartRouter`","","Example for a pizza project: `Pizza` entity → `CreatePizza` command → `pizza.routes.ts`. The base handles everything else (auth, validation pipeline, docs, error handling).","","---","","## Base Polish Items (not domain gaps)","","These are worth addressing in the starter itself, not per-project:","","1. **Missing explicit dependencies** — `express` and `zod` used but not in [`package.json`](package.json)","2. **Unnecessary `crypto` npm package** — Node provides this natively","3. **Duplicate/unused code** — auth logic inlined in `auth.routes.ts` while [`Login.ts`](src/Application/services/auth/commands/Login.ts) / [`RefreshAccessToken.ts`](src/Application/services/auth/commands/RefreshAccessToken.ts) exist unused; dead files: `defineRoute.ts`, `asyncHandler.ts`, `BaseAuthService.ts`","4. **Dual PrismaClient instances** — singleton vs DI container","5. **No README / `.env.example`** — critical for a reusable base","6. **No test suite** — only manual scripts in `src/Test/user/`","","Minor inconsistencies (fine to fix in base): `PUT /users/:id` returns 203; `POST /users` requires auth (intentional for admin provisioning)."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000229,15,1000230,15,1000231,1000232,1000233,1000234,1000235,15,1000236,15,1,15,1000237,15,1000238,15,1000239,1000240,1000241,1000242,1000243,1000244,15,1000245]},{"originalStartLineNumberOneIndexed":221,"originalEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":241,"modifiedStartLineNumberOneIndexed":251,"modifiedEndLineNumberExclusiveOneIndexed":271,"addedLines":["**As a reusable base, this is well-designed:**","- Layer boundaries are enforced, not just documented","- Patterns are consistent and easy to copy for new features","- Auth is production-grade (refresh rotation, reuse detection)","- OpenAPI docs are generated automatically from route definitions","","**To make it a great starter template**, the main gaps are documentation (README, `.env.example`), consolidating the auth use cases, and a test suite for the core base features.","","---","","## Suggested Next Steps","","Prioritized for improving the **base itself** (not building pizza features):","","1. **Document the starter** — README with architecture overview, setup steps, and \"how to add a new feature\" guide; `.env.example`","2. **Polish the base** — explicit deps, consolidate auth into use cases, remove dead code, unify PrismaClient","3. **Wire up roles** — makes the base useful for admin/customer apps out of the box","4. **Add base tests** — auth flow, user CRUD, SmartRouter validation","","When starting a specific project (e.g. pizza delivery), clone this base and add domain modules following the extension checklist above."],"tokenizedAddedLines":[1000246,1000247,1000248,1000249,1000250,15,1000251,15,1,15,1000252,15,1000253,15,1000254,1000255,1000256,1000257,15,1000258]}],"gitInfo":{"noRepoFound":true},"kind":"KIND_MODIFIED"}